  "description": "QR Code Barcode Generator VB.NET sample code: The nuget package includes detailed VB.NET source code to create, print QR Code barcode in ASP.NET, MVC, web, Windows applications.\n\nBarcode Output Types :\n* Raster images: BITMAP (.bmp), JPEG, PNG, TIFF, GIF\n* Vector images: SVG, EPS\n* Stream objects or Byte array\n\nCompatible with :\n* .NET Framework 4.x, 3.x, 2.x\n\nOnline Guides :\n* VB.NET Guide : https://www.onbarcode.com/tutorial/vb-net-barcode-generation.html\n* Contact US : support@onbarcode.com",
